title: "scRNA-seq lncRNA Analysis of T2D Monocytes"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-06-10
url: "https://github.com/usamamanzoor1121-pixel/lncrna-t2d-monocyte"
abstract: >
  Single-cell transcriptomic dissection of lncRNA regulatory programmes
  along the monocyte activation continuum in type 2 diabetes.
  Identifies AC020656.1 as a novel blood-accessible T2D biomarker candidate
  and NEAT1 as a marker of CD14 Classical monocyte inflammatory identity.
keywords:
  - single-cell RNA-seq
  - lncRNA
  - type 2 diabetes
  - monocyte
  - pseudotime
  - NEAT1
  - blood biomarker
